# 11 Global Engineering Model

{% include "_always_on_header.md.j2" %}


## Purpose
Primary card for **Route 8 — Global engineering and DGS**. When the question is about offshore teams, distributed pods, engineering standards, or onshore/offshore alignment, this card drives the answer.


## Answer shape
1. Set operating model.
2. Define architecture ownership.
3. Define delivery cadence.
4. Define quality gates.
5. Explain how onshore / offshore stays aligned.

